+# Design: Building Your Carry-Forward Inventory
+
+## Frame
+
+- 1920 × 1080, deep navy field with a quiet dot-grid texture.
+- Content stays inside 120 px frame padding and above the reserved footer.
+- Persistent top-left program label and top-right lesson marker provide continuity.
+
+## Type
+
+- Proxima Nova with the system fallback from `tokens.yml`.
+- Headlines: 72–104 px, 900 weight.
+- Supporting copy: 40–48 px, 400–700 weight.
+- Labels: 22–24 px, uppercase, tracked.
+
+## Components
+
+- **Question tag:** white paper tag, gold eyelet, blue rule.
+- **Inventory drawers:** four white cards with a numbered marker, category label, compact prompt, and one symbolic line icon.
+- **Portable filter:** two-column “comes with you / leave in context” sorter.
+- **Carry-forward case:** rounded white outline with four colored inventory bars and a forward arrow.
+
+## Motion
+
+- One paused GSAP timeline, registered as `m4_building-your-carry-forward-inventory`.
+- Each beat is a timed `.clip`; its elements enter within 1.2 seconds and exit before the next beat.
+- Use short slides, rule draws, check resolves, and finite emphasis pulses only.
+- The final case closes, fills, and shifts right during the last second.
+
